  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8402.09 Participating person",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8402.09 “Participating person” means “participating person” as defined in RSA 106-B:35, III. The term includes a person with a disability who has been granted participation in the contact person notification program.\n\nSource. #14340, eff 8-14-25, EXPIRES: 8-14-35",
